sequenceDiagram
    participant Timer as vsync timer (UI thread)
    participant UI as tick_ui
    participant SB as snapshot_buffer
    participant CV as render_cv
    participant RT as render thread
    participant TR as tick_render

    loop each vsync interval
        Timer->>UI: on_vsync()
        UI->>UI: wayland.dispatch + scene.update
        UI->>SB: commit_frame(index)
        UI->>CV: notify render_pending
        CV->>RT: wake
        RT->>TR: tick_render()
        TR->>SB: acquire_render_snapshot()
        TR->>TR: Vulkan record (P1)
    end
